// Triage successful logons (Event ID 4624). Read three fields before concluding:
//  - Account:       ANONYMOUS LOGON = benign noise; a real account = investigate
//  - LogonTypeName: Type 3 (Network) = SMB negotiation; Type 10 (RemoteInteractive) = real RDP
//  - IpAddress:     your own IP vs an external attacker IP
// A real account + Type 10 + external IP would indicate an actual compromise.
SecurityEvent
| where EventID == 4624
| where LogonType == 3
| project TimeGenerated, Account, LogonTypeName, IpAddress, WorkstationName
| order by TimeGenerated desc
